I couldn't test either page. Both load as an empty Angular shell (`<app-root></app-root>`) and never render any content. The app waits on a silent login check to `auth.sciencecloud.nasa.gov`, and that request failed with `net::ERR_FAILED` in this browser. With no rendered content, I have no evidence for any criterion. I'm marking every criterion NEEDS_REVIEW rather than guessing a PASS or DNA.

Someone should re-test with a browser that can reach the auth host, or from a network where it works.

